    {
      "ja": "• 頭部パーツのバランスを調整し、太腿のパーツ分割を変更。よりスタイリッシュに。",
      "en": "• Adjusted the balance of the head parts and changed the division of thigh parts. More stylish."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 可動性向上のため、肩部はボール軸へ変更。",
      "en": "• To improve mobility, the shoulder has been changed to a ball axis."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• パーツ新造で腕を前後に引き出すことが可能に。",
      "en": "• New parts make it possible to pull the arms forward and backward."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• バスターランチャーは色分け向上のため新規金型で作成。",
      "en": "• The Buster Launcher is made with a new mold to improve color separation."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• アクションベース５へ取り付け可能な新規ジョイントパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• New joint parts that can be attached to Action Base 5 are included."
